        "app.ploteverything.title": "PlotEverything",
        "app.ploteverything.abstract": "PlotEverything brings data visualization, crystal structures, and simulated XRD patterns into one scientific figure workspace. Researchers can turn spreadsheet data into publication-ready plots, compose multipanel figures, and export finished graphics without writing code.",
        "app.xmatcher.title": "XMatcher",
        "app.xmatcher.abstract": "XMatcher makes diffraction search and matching transparent and reproducible. It combines searchable crystal-structure databases, fast candidate retrieval, and interactive peak-level evidence to help researchers evaluate phase assignments in experimental XRD patterns.",
